OL,3,GNEWSAWorld Town Crier Tournament 2026:
OL,4,AEverything you need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FTown criers from across the globe are
OL,7,Fgathering in Chester for the 2026 World
OL,8,FTown Crier Tournament which begins
OL,9,Flater.
OL,11,FThe event will see 25 town criers
OL,12,Fcompeting from England, the Channel
OL,13,FIslands, Belgium, Germany, the
OL,14,FNetherlands, Australia, Canada and the
OL,15,FUnited States.
OL,17,FSouthport and Sefton's town crier Kevin
OL,18,FRuane will be one of them, having
OL,19,Fpreviously told the BBC he went into it
OL,20,Fafter his wife told him "you'd be good
OL,21,Fat that because you've got a big gob".
